	"intro": [
		{
			"text": "This cloak comes in 6 different types. Each are made in the same way, apart from the Soul that determines the type of cloak you wish to make."
		},
		{
			"text": "The Reanimator's Cloak can be found in the Crypt of Home dungeon and the items to upgrade it to a Cloak of the Reanimated drop off the Escaped Prisoners in Milky Way."
		},
		{
			"text": "You will only need 1 Soul to make the base cloak. To further upgrade it you will need 4 of each type."
		}
